# Environment Variables

## Backend (.env)

```
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://helixguard:helixguard@localhost:5432/helixguard
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
JWT_SECRET_KEY=change-me-in-production
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60
DEBUG=true
CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000"]

# Report email delivery (Mailhog in Docker Compose)
SMTP_ENABLED=true
SMTP_HOST=mailhog
SMTP_PORT=1025
SMTP_FROM=helixguard@acme.com
SMTP_USE_TLS=false
# View captured mail at http://localhost:8025 when using Mailhog

# Optional Hashicorp Vault for tenant API keys (BL-033)
# VAULT_ENABLED=false
# VAULT_ADDR=http://localhost:8200
# VAULT_AUTH_METHOD=token
# VAULT_TOKEN=dev-root-token
# VAULT_ROLE_ID=
# VAULT_SECRET_ID=
# VAULT_MOUNT_PATH=secret

# Scheduled LLM routing rebalance (Celery beat, UTC)
# LLM_REBALANCE_SCHEDULE_ENABLED=true
# LLM_REBALANCE_CRON_HOUR=2
# LLM_REBALANCE_CRON_MINUTE=0
```

## Frontend (.env.local)

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-google-maps-api-key
```

Enable **Maps JavaScript API** in [Google Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis) and restrict the key to your domains. Without this key, the Data Residency Map shows a bar-chart fallback instead of an interactive map.
